 Check for NaN and decide:\n","\n","* Low granularity: Drop rows with missing total_emissions_MtCO2e.\n","\n","* Medium/High: Fill missing production/emission values (e.g., with median or interpolation)."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"TPl64MYggNoa"},"outputs":[],"source":["df_low = df_low.dropna(subset=['total_emissions_MtCO2e'])\n","df_medium = df_medium.fillna(df_medium.median(numeric_only=True))\n","df_high = df_high.fillna(df_high.median(numeric_only=True))\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"9h1GIQTmvJtL"},"source":["**2. Encode Categorical Features**\n","\n","Convert text features into numeric for ML:\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"JRcEo1jk2LFd"},"outputs":[],"source":["if 'parent_type' in df_low.columns:\n","    df_low = pd.get_dummies(df_low, columns=['parent_type'])\n","\n","if 'commodity' in df_medium.columns:\n","    df_medium = pd.get_dummies(df_medium, columns=['commodity'])\n","\n","if 'dominant_source' in df_high.columns:\n","    df_high = pd.get_dummies(df_high, columns=['dominant_source'])\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"bFXa8p-22aPR"},"source":["**3. Normalize / Scale Numerical Features**\n","\n","Machine learning models (especially linear/logistic regression, SVM, NN) need scaling."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"8dlrJX512lxn"},"outputs":[],"source":["from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n","\n","scaler = StandardScaler()\n","\n","# --- Low emissions dataset ---\n","num_cols_low = [col for col in ['total_emissions_MtCO2e', 'emission_change']\n","                if col in df_low.columns]\n","if num_cols_low:\n","    df_low[num_cols_low] = scaler.fit_transform(df_low[num_cols_low])\n","\n","# --- Medium emissions dataset ---\n","num_cols_med = [col for col in ['total_emissions_MtCO2e', 'production_value', 'emission_intensity']\n","                if col in df_medium.columns]\n","if num_cols_med:\n","    df_medium[num_cols_med] = scaler.fit_transform(df_medium[num_cols_med])\n","\n","# --- High emissions dataset ---\n","num_cols_high = [col for col in df_high.columns if '_ratio' in col]\n","if 'op_inefficiency_score' in df_high.columns:\n","    num_cols_high.append('op_inefficiency_score')\n","if num_cols_high:\n","    df_high[num_cols_high] = scaler.fit_transform(df_high[num_cols_high])\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"5A3CJndX8_Sl"},"source":["**Train-Test Split**\n","\n","Split each dataset for ML tasks.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"ETVt5odq9P6j"},"outputs":[],"source":["from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","\n","# Low → classification\n","X_low = df_low.drop(columns=['compliance'])\n","y_low = df_low['compliance']\n","X_train_low, X_test_low, y_train_low, y_test_low = train_test_split(X_low, y_low, test_size=0.2, random_state=42, stratify=y_low)\n","\n","# Medium → regression\n","X_med = df_medium.drop(columns=['total_emissions_MtCO2e'])\n","y_med = df_medium['total_emissions_MtCO2e']\n","X_train_med, X_test_med, y_train_med, y_test_med = train_test_split(X_med, y_med, test_size=0.2, random_state=42)\n","\n","# High → regressionz\n","X_high = df_high.drop(columns=['total_emissions_MtCO2e'])\n","y_high = df_high['total_emissions_MtCO2e']\n","X_train_high, X_test_high, y_train_high, y_test_high = train_test_split(X_high, y_high, test_size=0.2, random_state=42)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"PxvHj00rMxrb"},"source":["## **Modeling Workflow**\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"HiDBY1VoNIWg"},"source":["**1. Low Granularity → Classification (Compliance or Not)**\n","\n","Target: compliance (0 = exceeds, 1 = compliant)."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":45382,"status":"ok","timestamp":1757849124837,"user":{"displayName":"Garvita Aggarwal","userId":"10788119665591853136"},"user_tz":-330},"id":"Afe5vLTCNFtC","outputId":"2ce95e84-146c-4853-f77c-8931ccb96271"},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Logistic Regression Accuracy: 0.9678747940691927\n","              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n","\n","           0       0.98      0.95      0.96       531\n","           1       0.96      0.99      0.97       683\n","\n","    accuracy                           0.97      1214\n","   macro avg       0.97      0.97      0.97      1214\n","weighted avg       0.97      0.97      0.97      1214\n","\n","Cross-validation scores: [1.         0.99917628 1.         1.         1.        ]\n","Mean cross-validation accuracy: 0.9998352553542009\n","Random Forest Accuracy: 1.0\n","              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n","\n","           0       1.00      1.00      1.00       531\n","           1       1.00      1.00      1.00       683\n","\n","    accuracy                           1.00      1214\n","   macro avg       1.00      1.00      1.00      1214\n","weighted avg       1.00      1.00      1.00      1214\n","\n"]}],"source":["from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n","from sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score\n","from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\n","from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n","from sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, classification_report\n","import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# Features & target\n","X_low = df_low.drop(columns=['compliance'])\n","y_low = df_low['compliance']\n","\n","# One-hot encode categoricals\n","X_low = pd.get_dummies(X_low, drop_first=True)\n","\n","# --- Impute missing values ---\n","imputer = SimpleImputer(strategy=\"mean\")\n","X_low = pd.DataFrame(imputer.fit_transform(X_low), columns=X_low.columns)\n","\n","# Train-test split\n","X_train_low, X_test_low, y_train_low, y_test_low = train_test_split(\n","    X_low, y_low, test_size=0.2, random_state=42, stratify=y_low\n",")\n","\n","# Logistic Regression\n","log_reg = LogisticRegression(max_iter=5000)\n","log_reg.fit(X_train_low, y_train_low)\n","y_pred_lr = log_reg.predict(X_test_low)\n","\n","print(\"Logistic Regression Accuracy:\", accuracy_score(y_test_low, y_pred_lr))\n","print(classification_report(y_test_low, y_pred_lr))\n","\n","# Random Forest\n","rf_clf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=200, random_state=42)\n","rf_clf.fit(X_train_low, y_train_low)\n","y_pred_rf = rf_clf.predict(X_test_low)\n","scores = cross_val_score(rf_clf, X_low, y_low, cv=5, scoring='accuracy')\n","\n","print(\"Cross-validation scores:\", scores)\n","print(\"Mean cross-validation accuracy:\", np.mean(scores))\n","\n","print(\"Random Forest Accuracy:\", accuracy_score(y_test_low, y_pred_rf))\n","print(classification_report(y_test_low, y_pred_rf))\n","\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"hfLe1FelKrIH"},"source":["**2. Medium Granularity → Regression (Predict total emissions)**\n","\n","Target: total_emissions_MtCO2e\n","\n","Models to try: Linear Regression, Random Forest Regressor."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":24486,"status":"ok","timestamp":1757849306364,"user":{"displayName":"Garvita Aggarwal","userId":"10788119665591853136"},"user_tz":-330},"id":"6Avn51w9NhjH","outputId":"801044a6-6a70-47a7-ec96-afb4c88266d5"},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Linear Regression RMSE: 0.711757239408821\n","Linear Regression R² Score: 0.4033900575881101\n","Random Forest RMSE: 0.03722917474992686\n","Random Forest R² Score: 0.998367724285409\n"]}],"source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n","from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n","from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\n","from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, r2_score\n","\n","# --- Features & target ---\n","# Drop target column from features\n","X_medium = df_medium.drop(columns=['total_emissions_MtCO2e'])\n","y_medium = df_medium['total_emissions_MtCO2e']\n","\n","# --- One-hot encode categorical columns ---\n","categorical_cols = X_medium.select_dtypes(include=['object']).columns.tolist()\n","if categorical_cols:\n","    X_medium = pd.get_dummies(X_medium, columns=categorical_cols, drop_first=True)\n","\n","# --- Impute missing values ---\n","imputer = SimpleImputer(strategy='mean')\n","X_medium = pd.DataFrame(imputer.fit_transform(X_medium), columns=X_medium.columns)\n","\n","# --- Train-test split ---\n","X_train_med, X_test_med, y_train_med, y_test_med = train_test_split(\n","    X_medium, y_medium, test_size=0.2, random_state=42\n",")\n","\n","# --- Linear Regression ---\n","lin_reg = LinearRegression()\n","lin_reg.fit(X_train_med, y_train_med)\n","y_pred_med = lin_reg.predict(X_test_med)\n","\n","print(\"Linear Regression RMSE:\", np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_test_med, y_pred_med)))\n","print(\"Linear Regression R² Score:\", r2_score(y_test_med, y_pred_med))\n","\n","# --- Random Forest Regressor ---\n","rf_reg = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=200, random_state=42)\n","rf_reg.fit(X_train_med, y_train_med)\n","y_pred_rf_med = rf_reg.predict(X_test_med)\n","\n","print(\"Random Forest RMSE:\", np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_test_med, y_pred_rf_med)))\n","print(\"Random Forest R² Score:\", r2_score(y_test_med, y_pred_rf_med))\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"WyDDy1JONtGS"},"source":["**3. High Granularity → Regression (Predict total emissions)**"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":36,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"_T-6kKcRN0Sl","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1757851365130,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":270650,"user":{"displayName":"Garvita Aggarwal","userId":"10788119665591853136"}},"outputId":"638c980a-5cb6-46f5-9ede-035c16c39bbe"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["High Granularity Linear RMSE: 8.201446978528275e-14\n","R² Score: 1.0\n","High Granularity RF RMSE: 0.9742938467386495\n","R² Score: 0.998753810978481\n"]}],"source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n","from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n","from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\n","from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, r2_score\n","\n","# --- Features & target ---\n","X_high = df_high.drop(columns=['total_emissions_MtCO2e'])  # replace with your target column\n","y_high = df_high['total_operational_emissions_MtCO2e']     # example target, adjust if needed\n","\n","# --- One-hot encode categorical columns ---\n","categorical_cols = X_high.select_dtypes(include=['object']).columns.tolist()\n","if categorical_cols:\n","    X_high = pd.get_dummies(X_high, columns=categorical_cols, drop_first=True)\n","\n","# --- Impute missing values ---\n","imputer = SimpleImputer(strategy='mean')\n","X_high = pd.DataFrame(imputer.fit_transform(X_high), columns=X_high.columns)\n","\n","# --- Train-test split ---\n","X_train_high, X_test_high, y_train_high, y_test_high = train_test_split(\n","    X_high, y_high, test_size=0.2, random_state=42\n",")\n","\n","# --- Linear Regression ---\n","lin_reg_high = LinearRegression()\n","lin_reg_high.fit(X_train_high, y_train_high)\n","y_pred_high = lin_reg_high.predict(X_test_high)\n","\n","print(\"High Granularity Linear RMSE:\", np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_test_high, y_pred_high)))\n","print(\"R² Score:\", r2_score(y_test_high, y_pred_high))\n","\n","# --- Random Forest Regressor ---\n","rf_reg_high = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=200, random_state=42)\n","rf_reg_high.fit(X_train_high, y_train_high)\n","y_pred_rf_high = rf_reg_high.predict(X_test_high)\n","\n","print(\"High Granularity RF RMSE:\", np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_test_high, y_pred_rf_high)))\n","print(\"R² Score:\", r2_score(y_test_high, y_pred_rf_high))\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"DUHIxHrCN07j"},"source":["**4. Decision Layer (Compliance Optimizer)**\n","\n","Once you predict emissions (medium/high), compare with threshold:"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":33,"metadata":{"id":"AtxxSmQ2N5JR","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1757850679036,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":17,"user":{"displayName":"Garvita Aggarwal","userId":"10788119665591853136"}},"outputId":"46c0fa18-e37a-450a-82ec-68b2669ccfd9"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Medium Granularity Compliance Decisions:\n","   Predicted_Emission     Decision\n","0           -0.290183  Compliant ✅\n","1           -0.329632  Compliant ✅\n","2           -0.054442  Compliant ✅\n","3           -0.229302  Compliant ✅\n","4           -0.242262  Compliant ✅\n","\n","High Granularity Compliance Decisions:\n","   Predicted_Emission     Decision\n","0            2.499490  Compliant ✅\n","1            2.554248  Compliant ✅\n","2            0.970000  Compliant ✅\n","3            0.000000  Compliant ✅\n","4            1.312281  Compliant ✅\n"]}],"source":["# Example threshold (replace with your target, e.g., Paris/NDC goal)\n","threshold = 100\n","\n","# Compliance decision function\n","def compliance_decision(predicted_emission, threshold):\n","    if predicted_emission <= threshold:\n","        return \"Compliant ✅\"\n","    elif predicted_emission <= threshold * 1.1:  # within 10% exceedance\n","        return \"Buy Credits 💳\"\n","    else:\n","        return \"Reduce Emissions ⚠️\"\n","\n","# --- Apply to medium granularity predictions ---\n","df_medium_decision = pd.DataFrame({\n","    'Predicted_Emission': y_pred_rf_med,\n","    'Decision': [compliance_decision(pred, threshold) for pred in y_pred_rf_med]\n","})\n","\n","print(\"Medium Granularity Compliance Decisions:\")\n","print(df_medium_decision.head())\n","\n","# --- Apply to high granularity predictions ---\n","df_high_decision = pd.DataFrame({\n","    'Predicted_Emission': y_pred_rf_high,\n","    'Decision': [compliance_decision(pred, threshold) for pred in y_pred_rf_high]\n","})\n","\n","print(\"\\nHigh Granularity Compliance Decisions:\")\n","print(df_high_decision.head())\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"ow3GSS9bOiI3"},"source":["## **Evaluate Model Performance**\n","\n","Even after the decision layer, you need to measure how good your model is."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"BFvv3uDDOwSv"},"source":["**For Classification (Low Granularity):**\n","\n","* Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-score\n","* Confusion Matrix (shows true vs predicted compliance)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":39,"metadata":{"id":"f56QtTSYOmmA","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":646},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1757851675014,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":910,"user":{"displayName":"Garvita Aggarwal","userId":"10788119665591853136"}},"outputId":"e9950aec-cb8b-4788-8372-3f157ce4ae6f"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Accuracy: 1.0\n","              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n","\n","           0       1.00      1.00      1.00       531\n","           1       1.00      1.00      1.00       683\n","\n","    accuracy                           1.00      1214\n","   macro avg       1.00      1.00      1.00      1214\n","weighted avg       1.00      1.00      1.00      1214\n","\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}],"source":["from sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, classification_report, confusion_matrix\n","import seaborn as sns\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","\n","# Random Forest on low granularity\n","y_pred = rf_clf.predict(X_test_low)\n","print(\"Accuracy:\", accuracy_score(y_test_low, y_pred))\n","print(class